From a5fbc43df1d2fbae8829236be34ff965d2fb7509 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:35:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rename the assistant from Rito to Rita

Rita is the new name of the retirobtc.mx AI assistant. This renames the
identity users actually see: the chat widget button, its panel header,
the greeting, the system prompt, the multilingual help notes on the
calculator, the privacy notice and the escalation emails.

Internal plumbing keeps the rito namespace on purpose, because renaming
it breaks deployed contracts rather than the brand:

  - /widget/rito.js and rito-loader.js are URLs already cached by
    browsers and referenced by the deployed static site.
  - RITO_CHAT_MODEL is an environment variable configured in Vercel.
  - #rito-* DOM ids, .rito-msg classes, the rito_session localStorage
    key, the RETIROBTC_RITO flag and the ?rito=0 query parameter are
    all runtime state that users may already have set.

window.Rita is the new widget API, with window.Rito kept as an alias in
case an external embed still calls it.
